# Pin line endings so the working tree is always LF.
#
# Without this, a machine with core.autocrlf=true checks the repository out as
# CRLF. Git then sees no difference (it reverses the conversion on comparison),
# but `gofmt -l .` disagrees and reports every Go file as unformatted. That
# trap is invisible in CI and only appears on a fresh clone on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts are never line-ending-normalised.
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
